# The Tokyo Night theme.
Set Width 1584
Set Height 800
Source "docs/tapes/ambiente.tape"
Output "docs/media/.scarto/tema-tokyo-night.gif"
Type "rada --icons nerd --images halfblocks --theme tokyo-night --demo vetrina ~/projects/demo"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show
Sleep 2500ms
Screenshot "docs/screenshots/tema-tokyo-night.png"
